# On first boot (machine-id "uninitialized") systemd applies the presets to every service;
# 90-systemd.preset enables a few services we don't use. The first matching line
# wins, so this file (80) is read before it.

# NetworkManager manages networking. With networkd enabled, networkd-wait-online waited
# 2 minutes for a connection that never came (network-online.target and the units that
# depend on it, zapret and nos-update, started 2 min after boot).
disable systemd-networkd.service
disable systemd-networkd.socket
disable systemd-networkd-varlink.socket
disable systemd-networkd-varlink-metrics.socket
disable systemd-networkd-resolve-hook.socket
disable systemd-networkd-wait-online.service
disable systemd-network-generator.service

# Portable/encrypted home directories (homectl); users are regular accounts.
disable systemd-homed.service
disable systemd-homed-activate.service

# For attaching extension layers (sysext/confext) to the system; currently unused.
# If something needs them, enable them here (see CLAUDE.md).
disable systemd-sysext.service
disable systemd-confext.service
